# Review

## Purpose

A fast, consistent checklist to verify a diff honors the contract before merge.

## When Applied

Request during code review or pre-merge (Reviewer, Orchestrator, Release).

## Requirements

Check the diff for:

- **Stack**: no Provider/Riverpod/GetX/injectable/Freezed/Dio/new router.
- **Boundaries**: remote I/O only in repos/datasources; multi-step work via RPC.
- **DI**: new types registered in `lib/core/di/injection.dart` with correct lifetime.
- **Shell**: authenticated UI enters via `AuthenticatedShell`.
- **Cache**: cache-first preserved; invalidation via existing sync helpers.
- **Security**: no `service_role`/secrets; RLS not weakened.
- **Scope**: no drive-by refactors or legacy deletions.
- **Naming/models**: conventions per [`../flutter/naming-imports.mdc`](../flutter/naming-imports.mdc) and [`../flutter/models-mapping.mdc`](../flutter/models-mapping.mdc).
- Gate against [`../core/02-definition-of-done.mdc`](../core/02-definition-of-done.mdc).

## Examples

- Flag a widget calling `Supabase.instance` and request a repository method.

## Anti-patterns

- Approving a DB-touching PR with no RLS/RPC note.

## Common Mistakes

- Reviewing only the latest commit instead of the full diff.
- Missing an unregistered new BLoC/repository.
